  "issue_title": "Trend judge disagreement over benchmark runs",
  "issue_body": "**Context**\nThis PR exposes `judge_order_stats` for each replay, which gives us the raw signal for judge instability. The next step is to make that signal visible over time so maintainers can tell whether disagreement rate changes after judge prompt, model, or benchmark changes.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n- [ ] Persist `judge_order_stats` in any stored benchmark/replay result artifacts.\n- [ ] Add a small summary in benchmark reporting that shows disagreement rate alongside win/tie outcomes.\n- [ ] Add tests covering historical/result serialization with `judge_order_stats` present and absent.\n\n**Pointers**: `benchmark/runner.py`, `benchmark/judge.py`, result reporting/serialization code.",
